  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following points lies on the tangent to the curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> at the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>?"
  },
  "options": [
